ot bronze Mama Bear and learn why the plaza honors university alumni.","short_summary":"Use a prominent bronze landmark to connect the arts and athletics sides of campus.","evidence_claim":"Alumni Plaza sits between Bauman Auditorium and Stoffer Family Stadium and centers on a 10-foot-tall, 800-pound bronze bear called Mama Bear.","source_url":"https://www.georgefox.edu/maps_locations/alumni-plaza.html","source_title":"Alumni Plaza","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The source describes an outdoor plaza; remain in designated pedestrian areas and respect any event controls nearby.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gfu-stoffer-family-stadium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Stoffer Family Stadium","title":"Locate the Bruins’ Home Field","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Athletics orientation","notes":"View the stadium from an authorized public approach, identify Lemmons Family Field, and check athletics listings before planning a game visit.","short_summary":"Learn where George Fox football and track-and-field events take place.","evidence_claim":"Stoffer Family Stadium is home to George Fox football and track and field and includes a covered grandstand, Lemmons Family Field, and Duke Athletic Center.","source_url":"https://athletics.georgefox.edu/facilities/stoffer-family-stadium/2","source_title":"Stoffer Family Stadium","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"General facility access is not established by the source; enter only for a scheduled event or when the university permits access.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gfu-bauman-auditorium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Bauman Auditorium","title":"Check the Campus Performance Venue","subt