atic-fitness-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Chehalem Aquatic & Fitness Center","title":"Finish with a Sunday Swim or Workout","subtitle":"Sunday · Use the student-access partnership","notes":"Show your current George Fox student ID at the front desk, ask which facilities are available, and confirm the day’s pool schedule first.","short_summary":"Close the weekend at the public recreation facility beside campus.","evidence_claim":"Current George Fox traditional undergraduates and Newberg-based graduate students receive free access to Chehalem Aquatic & Fitness Center by showing a student ID.","source_url":"https://www.georgefox.edu/recreation/student-center/access.html","source_title":"Hadlock Membership & Access","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Show a current George Fox student ID at the center’s front desk. Pool availability may differ from overall facility hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
